// ============================================================================
// FIDELIS TEST SUITE: ALL INVALID LEXICAL RULES
// ============================================================================

// Rule 1: Illegal / Unrecognized Characters
@
$
#
~
`

// Rule 2: Malformed Numeric Literals / Identifier Starting with Digits
123badVariable
45_invalid
42.
3.14invalidFloat

// Rule 3: Identifier Exceeding Max Length Limit (32 Characters Max)
thisIdentifierNameIsWayTooLongAndExceedsThirtyTwoChars

// Rule 4: Unterminated String Literal (Newline encountered before closing quote)
"This string is missing its closing quote

// Rule 5: Empty Character Literal
''

// Rule 6: Character Literal Exceeding Single Byte / Too Long
'ab'
'toolong'

// Rule 7: Unterminated Character Literal (Newline before closing single quote)
'x

// Rule 8: Incomplete Multi-character Operators (Standalone | or &)
| 
& 

// Rule 9: Unterminated Block Comment (Must be at the very end of file before EOF)
/* Unterminated block comment without closing star slash